    narr:narration """As of July 2026, the organizational stance regarding the analytics infrastructure is defined by a [formal migration decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_1) to move from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB. This shift is presented as a settled directive, supported by [quantified performance and cost justifications](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_2). The technical rationale centers on a projected [tenfold increase in query speed](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_4) alongside improved licensing economics. The transition is further codified through [session-level documentation](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_3) that formalizes the architectural change, while a [target implementation window](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_5) has been set for Q3 2026 to govern the execution phase.""" ;
